<br />
15. Crushbone and the Screaming Mace quest.
<br />
16. Complaining about getting Ganked for a 2gp piece of padded leather.
<br />
17. Zone plugging
<br />
18. Unrest zoneline camping
<br />
19. Ivvy Hoops
<br />
20. PoGrowth raids
<br />
21. The day we ALMOST dropped the sleeper.
<br />
22. The day we DID drop the sleeper.
<br />
23. GNOME SKIN ARMOR druids!!!
<br />

<br />
